WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.278 --> 00:00:07.042
In Points, tap the line to put a dot on it.

2
00:00:07.042 --> 00:00:10.275
Tap a dot to select it, then press Delete.

3
00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:12.172
Clear dots takes them all away.

4
00:00:12.172 --> 00:00:15.505
Today’s task: start at 48, then add 25 in three jumps.

5
00:00:15.505 --> 00:00:18.314
First set From and To so the line fits the task.

6
00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:21.573
Switch to Jumps. The first tap picks the start.

7
00:00:21.573 --> 00:00:25.380
Each next tap lands a jump: 20, then 2 to the ten, then 3.

8
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.121
The number sentence is written under the line.

9
00:00:28.121 --> 00:00:31.866
Undo jump takes back the last jump.

10
00:00:31.866 --> 00:00:35.760
Hide labels to make it an open number line.

11
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:44.340
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
